<div class="highlight-box">
    <strong>Our Unfair Competitive Advantages:</strong><br/>
    1. <strong>Working, Battle-Tested Prototype:</strong> We have a fully functional web platform running live on <code>http://127.0.0.1:5000</code> with 114 automated tests passing 100%.<br/>
    2. <strong>Zero Foreign Currency Barrier:</strong> Eliminates forex restrictions for Ethiopian municipalities.<br/>
    3. <strong>Native Alignment with ERA Standards:</strong> Direct integration with the Ethiopian Roads Administration Schedule of Rates and FIDIC procurement conditions.
</div>

<h2>6. Business Model and Commercialization Potential</h2>
<p>RoadEye™ utilizes a high-margin, scalable hybrid <strong>SaaS (Software-as-a-Service)</strong> and <strong>DaaS (Data-as-a-Service)</strong> business model:</p>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead>
        <tr>
