        <tr>
            <td><strong>1. Municipal SaaS Subscription</strong></td>
            <td>City Administrations & Municipalities</td>
            <td>Annual subscription: Basic (250,000 ETB/yr), Pro / Debre Berhan (650,000 ETB/yr), Enterprise Metro (1,800,000 ETB/yr)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>2. Pavement Inspection-as-a-Service (PIaaS)</strong></td>
            <td>Regional Road Bureaus & ERA</td>
            <td>1,200 to 1,800 ETB per kilometer scanned (turnkey 3D CAD/GIS report)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>3. Contractor DLP Compliance Audit Reports</strong></td>
            <td>Road Construction Contractors</td>
            <td>45,000 &ndash; 120,000 ETB per project audit prior to final retention release</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>4. Fleet & Telemetry API Feeds</strong></td>
            <td>Transport Logistics & Insurance</td>
            <td>Monthly API access fee for live hazard coordinates & route quality</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

